{
  "parse": {
    "title": "The Lost Adventurer",
    "pageid": 92612,
    "revid": 719698,
    "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"messagebox boxcol-red\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-main\">\n<div class=\"messagebox-image nomobile\" style=\"\">\n<p><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Historic_content.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Historic_content.png/50px-Historic_content.png?25766\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Historic_content.png/100px-Historic_content.png?25766 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-text\" style=\"\">\n<p><b>The Lost Adventurer</b> was significantly altered or removed after 0.16. This article is retained for historical purposes.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"messagebox-aside\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">For the NPC that replaced <b>The Lost Adventurer</b>, see <a href=\"/w/Lone_Adventurer\" title=\"Lone Adventurer\">Lone Adventurer</a>.</div>\n<div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote navigation-not-searchable\">For the <a href=\"/w/Catacombs\" title=\"Catacombs\">Catacombs</a> <a href=\"/w/Minibosses\" title=\"Minibosses\"><span class=\"color-red\"><span class=\"monospace\"><b>MINIBOSS</b></span></span></a>, see <a href=\"/w/Lost_Adventurer\" title=\"Lost Adventurer\">Lost Adventurer</a>.</div>\n<div class=\"infobox\"><div class=\"infobox-title\">The Lost Adventurer</div><div class=\"infobox-panel\"><ul class=\"infobox-section-labels\"><li class=\"label-active\" style=\"display:none\"></li></ul><div class=\"section active\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><span class=\"mw-default-size pi-image-thumbnail\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:The_Lost_Adventurer_(Stage_5).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The Lost Adventurer (Stage 5).png\"><img alt=\"The Lost Adventurer (Stage 5).png\" src=\"/images/The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_5%29.png?281b9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"379\" height=\"512\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"379\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Type</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<a href=\"/w/NPC\" title=\"NPC\">NPC</a></div></div><div class=\"group\"><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Location</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<a href=\"/w/Hub_Island\" title=\"Hub Island\">Hub Island</a></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><b>The Lost Adventurer</b> was an NPC found in various locations around the <a href=\"/w/Hub_Island\" title=\"Hub Island\">Hub Island</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/The_Lost_Adventurer?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Dialogue\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/The_Lost_Adventurer?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Dialogue\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Dialogue\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">First interaction\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: What...? Where...? Why...?</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: </span><span class=\"format-7\">&lt;player&gt;</span><span class=\"format-d\">, you there! Where am I?</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">Select an option: </span><span class=\"format-a\">[The Hub Island?]</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Selecting <span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">[The Hub Island?]</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: What is... 'The Hub Island'?</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: I seem to be very lost...</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: Can you help me find my way home?</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">Select an option: </span><span class=\"format-a\">[Yes...]</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Selecting <span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-a\">[Yes...]</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: I can feel my home so close, it's here... and yet... it's not.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: It feels like yesterday, but perhaps... it has been longer.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: You seem smart... where should I go to find my home?</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">After completing dialogue without having reached <span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Combat\" title=\"Combat\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Stone_Sword.png/24px-Stone_Sword.png?8f5ba\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Stone_Sword.png/48px-Stone_Sword.png?8f5ba 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"font-initial\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/w/Combat\" title=\"Combat\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">Combat</span><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#160;XII (12)</span></span></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: As smart as you seem, you are not enough of a skilled warrior.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: I need you to help me find my home, however dangerous it may be.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: Reach Combat Level XII and come help me again!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">After completing dialogue\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: Please tell me where I can go to find my home!</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">Select an option: </span><span class=\"format-c\">[The High Level]    </span><span class=\"format-5\">[The End Island]</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Selecting <span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-c\">[The High Level]</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: So if you keep bugging me you think I'll tell you everything?</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: Well it's working...</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: You might be getting close to knowing the truth!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"ct\">Selecting <span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-5\">[The End Island]</span></span>\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: I would like to start growing stronger by killing some of those spiders.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: But I've always hated flying through the air.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: I've heard stepping on those launch pads will send me flying.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">:It sends shivers down my spine.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: I think I am just going to have to learn a different way over there.</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">[<span class=\"format-k\">NPC</span></span></span><span class=\"format-5\"><span class=\"format-l\">] </span></span><span class=\"format-5\">The Lost Adventurer</span><span class=\"format-d\">: Have you heard of anything I can use?</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/The_Lost_Adventurer?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/The_Lost_Adventurer?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-7\">Learning a way home...</span></span> was displayed over <b>The Lost Adventurer'</b>s head.</li>\n<li><b>The Lost Adventurer</b> was the only NPC to have its dialogue and location changed so often.</li>\n<li><b>The Lost Adventurer</b> was the only NPC with a <a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Levels\" title=\"SkyBlock Levels\">SkyBlock Level</a> above their head.\n<ul><li>The NPC's level was <span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-8\">[</span><span class=\"format-a\">82</span><span class=\"format-8\">]</span></span> while at <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Coordinates\" title=\"Coordinates\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Compass.png/16px-Compass.png?aa246\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Compass.png/32px-Compass.png?aa246 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"hidden\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/w/Coordinates\" title=\"Coordinates\">-94,&#8239;75,&#8239;-132</a></span>.</li>\n<li>The NPC's level was <span class=\"mcui-text\" style=\"display: inline; font-size: 12px;\"><span class=\"format-8\">[</span><span class=\"format-9\">127</span><span class=\"format-8\">]</span></span> while at <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Coordinates\" title=\"Coordinates\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Compass.png/16px-Compass.png?aa246\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Compass.png/32px-Compass.png?aa246 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span><span class=\"hidden\">&#160;</span><a href=\"/w/Coordinates\" title=\"Coordinates\">-156.5,&#8239;76,&#8239;-169.5</a></span>.</li></ul></li>\n<li><b>The Lost Adventurer</b> 'found their way home' and was replaced by the <span class=\"spriteicon notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Lone_Adventurer\" title=\"Lone Adventurer\"><img alt=\"A sprite icon representing Lone Adventurer in Hypixel SkyBlock\" src=\"/images/thumb/Lone_Adventurer_Sprite.png/16px-Lone_Adventurer_Sprite.png?7b276\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Lone_Adventurer_Sprite.png/32px-Lone_Adventurer_Sprite.png?7b276 2x\" data-file-width=\"288\" data-file-height=\"272\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Lone_Adventurer\" title=\"Lone Adventurer\">Lone Adventurer</a> in <a href=\"/w/The_End\" title=\"The End\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"color-light&#95;purple\" style=\"\">The End</span></a> once the island was revamped.\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"/w/NPC\" title=\"NPC\">NPC</a> had been teasing an update to the island throughout its existence.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/The_Lost_Adventurer?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Gallery\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/The_Lost_Adventurer?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Gallery\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Lost_Adventurer_(NPC).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The Lost Adventurer&#39;s original appearance on top of the  Community Center\"><img alt=\"The Lost Adventurer&#39;s original appearance on top of the  Community Center\" src=\"/images/thumb/Lost_Adventurer_%28NPC%29.png/57px-Lost_Adventurer_%28NPC%29.png?518fc\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"57\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Lost_Adventurer_%28NPC%29.png/114px-Lost_Adventurer_%28NPC%29.png?518fc 2x\" data-file-width=\"244\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Lost Adventurer's original appearance on top of the <a href=\"/w/Community_Center\" title=\"Community Center\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">Community Center</span></a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:The_Lost_Adventurer_(Stage_2).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The Lost Adventurer&#39;s first outfit, in the  Auction House\"><img alt=\"The Lost Adventurer&#39;s first outfit, in the  Auction House\" src=\"/images/thumb/The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_2%29.png/93px-The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_2%29.png?c383e\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"93\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_2%29.png/186px-The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_2%29.png?c383e 2x\" data-file-width=\"397\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Lost Adventurer's first outfit, in the <a href=\"/w/Auction_House\" title=\"Auction House\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">Auction House</span></a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:The_Lost_Adventurer_(Stage_3).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The Lost Adventurer&#39;s second outfit, in the  Tavern\"><img alt=\"The Lost Adventurer&#39;s second outfit, in the  Tavern\" src=\"/images/thumb/The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_3%29.png/89px-The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_3%29.png?7ea1a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"89\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_3%29.png/178px-The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_3%29.png?7ea1a 2x\" data-file-width=\"380\" data-file-height=\"512\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Lost Adventurer's second outfit, in the <a href=\"/w/Tavern\" title=\"Tavern\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont\"><span class=\"color-gray\" style=\"\">&#xe067; </span></span><span class=\"light-color color-aqua\" style=\"\">Tavern</span></a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:The_Lost_Adventurer_(Stage_4).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"The Lost Adventurer&#39;s third outfit, in the  Graveyard\"><img alt=\"The Lost Adventurer&#39;s third outfit, in the  Graveyard\" src=\"/images/thumb/The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_4%29.png/89px-The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_4%29.png?69f03\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"89\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_4%29.png/178px-The_Lost_Adventurer_%28Stage_4%29.png?69f03 2x